     1139       run gbl/d-inform.w
     1140         (  input self
     1141         ,  input this-procedure
     1142         , output v-action
     1143         ) no-error .
     1144       run gbl/infrmact.p (input self, input this-procedure, input v-action) no-error .
     1145       assign
     1146         v-inform-launched = false
     1147       .
     1148     end.
     1149   end.
